  "2026-10-14T06:54:04.084Z",codex-agent,"Native ICU English text/author tie ordering matches published 2026.10.14 item and history bytes. The linked exact ordering differential passed through pm test (one passed, zero ignored/filtered). Reverting only equal-time comment ordering compiled and failed that regression at runtime, then restored byte for byte. The unchanged full release gate passed 278 tests on each toolchain with all four measured coverage dimensions at 100 percent. Leaving open for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-14T06:54:15.030Z",codex-agent,"Count correction: the linked exact-name differential run passed one test with 15 other test functions filtered out, as expected for --exact. The preceding comment incorrectly described that targeted run as unfiltered. The full stable and instrumented release-check runs each passed all 278 tests with zero ignored or filtered tests."
